{"4330750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tiny Ramen Shop", "steam_appid": 4330750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4745970], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330750/extras/3ddeaf4e86c63be4a8fe862262b179d7.poster.avif?t=1788275940\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330750/extras/3ddeaf4e86c63be4a8fe862262b179d7.webm?t=1788275940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330750/extras/3ddeaf4e86c63be4a8fe862262b179d7.mp4?t=1788275940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Tiny Ramen Shop</strong> is a cozy first-person simulator where you get to manage a small ramen shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook for your customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330750/extras/5cec2f440893ec4909ebbf8e7325fcc2.poster.avif?t=1788275940\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330750/extras/5cec2f440893ec4909ebbf8e7325fcc2.webm?t=1788275940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330750/extras/5cec2f440893ec4909ebbf8e7325fcc2.mp4?t=1788275940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Create a rich, hearty ramen</strong> by frying pork or chicken with onions, eggs, mushrooms, nori, or tofu. Don't forget about the snacks and drinks too. Gyoza and green tea make the perfect combo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your inventory</strong>: restock your supplies so your kitchen is always full of fresh ingredients. It’s everything you need to create a delicious and aromatic ramen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade your shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330750/extras/ca7ea819efe911f07540cf9b1b078f1e.poster.avif?t=1788275940\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330750/extras/ca7ea819efe911f07540cf9b1b078f1e.webm?t=1788275940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330750/extras/ca7ea819efe911f07540cf9b1b078f1e.mp4?t=1788275940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Upgrade your shop</strong>: with each new level, you'll unlock upgrades for your kitchen. Cooking will become easier for you, and the food will be even tastier for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate your shop</strong>: buy an air conditioner, decor items, new lighting, and much more. Your customers will be thrilled!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330750/extras/3ddeaf4e86c63be4a8fe862262b179d7.poster.avif?t=1788275940\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330750/extras/3ddeaf4e86c63be4a8fe862262b179d7.webm?t=1788275940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330750/extras/3ddeaf4e86c63be4a8fe862262b179d7.mp4?t=1788275940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Tiny Ramen Shop</strong> is a cozy first-person simulator where you get to manage a small ramen shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook for your customers</strong></h2><p clas