e your shop</strong>: buy an air conditioner, decor items, new lighting, and much more. Your customers will be thrilled!</p>", "short_description": "Run your own Tiny Ramen Shop! It's tiny, yes, but customers are already lining up to try your delicious ramen. Prepare food, stock your warehouse with fresh ingredients, upgrade and decorate your establishment. Hungry customers are waiting for their favorite ramen chef!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Turkish, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330750/d804f63a6d85351f0771ffdb5d90cac0ec77a238/header.jpg?t=1788275940", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330750/4aac9c2aba5cb0e7a7147c8147b6b41ca9eb4675/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788275940", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330750/4aac9c2aba5cb0e7a7147c8147b6b41ca9eb4675/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788275940", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Yes<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Probably<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommende